NOTE ON THE DATASET

This licence covers the source code in this repository only.

The "Medical Appointment No Shows" dataset by JoniHoppen (Aquarela Analytics),
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/joniarroba/noshowappointments, is licensed
separately under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

The dataset is not redistributed in this repository. Its NonCommercial term
means neither the data nor a model trained on it may be used commercially.
